<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Castle Crashers Lightweight Juggle</Major>
    <Description>Simply jump and hold down your perfered keybind with the default controls in Castle Crashers and your character will automatically start lightweight juggling for you.

(does not work on green knight since the timing for green knight juggle is different than all the other characters)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 4 1
Delay 116 ms
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 99 ms
KeyDown 4 1
Delay 152 ms
KeyUp 4 1
Delay 116 ms
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 163 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 72 ms
KeyDown 26 1
Delay 196 ms
KeyUp 26 1
Delay 110 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Castle Crashers</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>